+      <tr><td valign="top" style="width:28px;font-weight:800;color:#0883F7;font-size:16px;padding:5px 0">3</td><td style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.65;color:#0f172a;padding:5px 0">Tomorrow, tap <strong>&ldquo;&#10003; Still available today&rdquo;</strong> &mdash; or update it if the truck moved. Every post expires automatically 24h after you last confirmed it; an expired one shows a <strong>Repost</strong> button.</td></tr>
